        "edge_media_to_caption": {
            "edges": [
                {
                    "node": {
                        "text": "\ud835\udd7e\ud835\udd95\ud835\udd8e\ud835\udd93\ud835\udd98\ud835\udd99\ud835\udd8a\ud835\udd97\ud835\udd98\n\nFinally getting around to posting some photos from mine and @toitoi_tejidos show for @bykerartsfestival \n\nSPINSTERS is a fashion show and performance piece celebrating the slow-paced art of crochet. \n\nThank you to everyone who took part and made our concept come to reality \ud83e\udd70 I had so much fun making these outfits and working with @toidinator to make our crochet dream world \ud83c\udff0\n\nArm and leg warmers by me \n\nPhotos: @toidinator \nModel: @kiikamor \nMake up: @face.art.by.jupiter"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
